{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Qwen Audio 3.1 TTS Flash 语音合成接口",
    "description": "将文本转换为语音音频，提供 68 个系统音色，支持自然语言指令、情感标签、SSML 和自定义发音，按实际 token 用量计费。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/audios/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Qwen Audio 3.1 TTS Flash 语音合成",
        "description": "- 将文本转换为语音音频，单次最多 `5000` 字符\n- 提供 68 个系统音色，完整列表见 [音色列表](/cn/api-manual/audio-series/qwen-audio-tts/qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash-voices)；也可以使用你自己用 [Voice Enrollment](/cn/api-manual/audio-series/qwen-audio-tts/voice-enrollment) 创建的音色（复刻或设计）\n- 自定义音色默认有效期为 `6 小时`，从创建任务完成时起算；到期后合成返回 `404`（`voice_expired`），需重新调用 Voice Enrollment 创建音色\n- 支持自然语言指令（`instruction`）、文本内情感与富语言标签、SSML、自定义发音（`hot_fix`）\n- 只接受下方列出的参数，传入其他参数返回 `400`（`unsupported_parameter`）\n- 异步处理模式，使用返回的任务ID [进行查询](/cn/api-manual/task-management/get-task-detail)\n- 任务提交后不支持取消\n- 生成的音频链接有效期为24小时，请尽快保存\n\n**计费说明：**\n- 按实际 token 用量计费：输入 token（与文本长度相关）和输出 token（与生成音频的时长相关）分别计价\n- 提交时按文本长度预扣积分（`usage.credits_reserved`），任务完成后按实际用量结算，多退少补；任务失败全额退还\n- 数字、字母、符号会被逐个念出来，生成的音频比同样长度的正文长得多，输出 token 也相应更多，实际消耗可能高于预扣\n- 同一段文本，放慢语速的指令或标签（如 `[very slowly]`）会让输出 token 明显增加；`speech_rate` 调节和 SSML 插入的停顿不增加输出 token\n\n**任务结果（`status` 为 `completed` 时）：**\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|---|---|\n| `results[0]` | 音频链接 |\n| `result_data[0].audio_url` | 音频链接，与 `results[0]` 相同 |\n| `result_data[0].format` | 音频格式 |\n| `result_data[0].sample_rate` | 采样率（Hz） |\n| `usage.input_tokens` / `usage.output_tokens` / `usage.total_tokens` | 本次合成的 token 用量 |\n| `usage.credits_used` | 实际消耗积分 |",
        "operationId": "createQwenAudio31TtsFlash",
        "tags": [
          "语音合成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QwenAudioTtsRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "basic": {
                  "summary": "最简调用（默认音色）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "prompt": "我家的后面有一个很大的花园。"
                  }
                },
                "aliases": {
                  "summary": "使用文本与格式别名",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "input": "我家的后面有一个很大的花园。",
                    "format": "mp3"
                  }
                },
                "with_voice": {
                  "summary": "指定音色与输出格式",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "prompt": "各位听众朋友，大家好，欢迎收听晚间新闻。",
                    "voice": "xuyanchu_v3.1",
                    "response_format": "wav",
                    "sample_rate": 48000
                  }
                },
                "expressive": {
                  "summary": "指令与情感标签",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "prompt": "[excited]今天的天气真不错！[laughing]我们一起出去玩吧！",
                    "voice": "longanhuan_v3.1",
                    "instruction": "用欢快、热情的语气说"
                  }
                },
                "english": {
                  "summary": "英文音色",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "prompt": "Hello, this is 110. Please leave a message after the tone.",
                    "voice": "Emily_v3.1",
                    "language": "en",
                    "speech_rate": 0.9
                  }
                },
                "ssml": {
                  "summary": "SSML 停顿",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "prompt": "<speak>欢迎收听今天的节目。<break time=\"1s\"/>我们马上开始。</speak>",
                    "enable_ssml": true
                  }
                },
                "full_params": {
                  "summary": "完整参数",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "prompt": "今天的天气真不错，适合出去走走。",
                    "voice": "yuxiaoyun_v3.1",
                    "response_format": "mp3",
                    "sample_rate": 24000,
                    "volume": 60,
                    "speech_rate": 1.1,
                    "pitch": 1.0,
                    "instruction": "语气轻松自然，像在和朋友聊天",
                    "language": "zh",
                    "enable_ssml": false,
                    "hot_fix": {
                      "pronunciation": [
                        {
                          "天气": "tian1 qi4"
                        }
                      ],
                      "replace": [
                        {
                          "走走": "走一走"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "enable_aigc_tag": false,
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/webhooks/tts-completed"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "语音合成任务创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QwenAudioTtsResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "missing_prompt": {
                    "summary": "缺少 prompt",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "missing_prompt",
                        "message": "prompt is required for qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "prompt_too_long": {
                    "summary": "prompt 超过 5000 字符",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "prompt_too_long",
                        "message": "prompt must be at most 5000 characters, got 5210",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "prompt_too_long_after_replace": {
                    "summary": "hot_fix.replace 替换后超过 5000 字符",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "prompt_too_long",
                        "message": "prompt must be at most 5000 characters after hot_fix.replace is applied, got 5120",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "hot_fix_too_many_entries": {
                    "summary": "hot_fix 条目超过 200 条",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "invalid_parameter",
                        "message": "hot_fix may contain at most 200 entries in total, got 201",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_voice": {
                    "summary": "音色不在支持列表中",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "invalid_voice",
                        "message": "voice \"longanhuan\" is not available for qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash; use a system voice from the voice list or a voice you created with voice-enrollment",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "instruction_too_long": {
                    "summary": "instruction 超过 100 计费字符",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "instruction_too_long",
                        "message": "instruction must be at most 100 billing characters (CJK characters count as 2), got 124",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "wrong_parameter_name": {
                    "summary": "参数名写错（instructions）",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "unsupported_parameter",
                        "message": "instructions is not supported; use \"instruction\"",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "unsupported_parameter": {
                    "summary": "传入了不支持的参数",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "unsupported_parameter",
                        "message": "seed is not supported for qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "opus_sample_rate": {
                    "summary": "opus 格式使用了不支持的采样率",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "invalid_parameter",
                        "message": "sample_rate 44100 is not supported with response_format=opus; use one of: 8000, 12000, 16000, 24000, 48000",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unauthorized",
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "insufficient_quota",
                    "message": "Insufficient quota. Please top up your account.",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "model_access_denied",
                    "message": "Token does not have access to model: qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "音色不存在或已过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "voice_not_found": {
                    "summary": "音色不存在或不属于当前账号",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "voice_not_found",
                        "message": "voice \"qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash-myvoice-5996beec833d41f4982158347ba97fae\" not found",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "voice_expired": {
                    "summary": "自定义音色已过期，需重新创建",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "voice_expired",
                        "message": "voice \"qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash-myvoice-5996beec833d41f4982158347ba97fae\" has expired; create a new one with voice-enrollment",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded",
                    "message": "Too many requests, please try again later",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "internal_error",
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "api_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "QwenAudioTtsRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model"
        ],
        "description": "`prompt` 和 `input` 至少提供一个非空文本；同时提供时内容必须一致。`response_format` 和 `format` 同时提供时取值必须一致。",
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "required": [
              "prompt"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "prompt": {
                "pattern": "\\S"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "required": [
              "input"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "input": {
                "pattern": "\\S"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型名称",
            "enum": [
              "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash"
            ],
            "default": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash",
            "example": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash"
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "待合成的文本\n\n**约束：**\n- 最多 `5000` 字符\n- 长文本请保留标点：没有句读的连续长段会被上游截断到约 `1500` 个输出 token（约 120 秒音频），任务仍报成功并按实际生成的 token 计费，网关无法检测这种截断\n- 也可用 `input` 传入，至少提供一个非空文本；建议只传一个，同时传入且内容不同时返回 `400`（`parameter_conflict`）\n- 文本须在所选音色支持的语言范围内，否则可能出现发音错误\n\n**情感与富语言标签：** 可直接在文本中嵌入标签，无需额外参数；标签文字计入计费字符\n- **控制类标签**：设定其后文本的情感或风格，直到遇到下一个控制类标签。`[sad]` 悲伤、`[amazed]` 惊叹、`[deep and loud shouting]` 深沉大声呐喊、`[trembling]` 颤抖、`[angry]` 愤怒、`[excited]` 兴奋、`[sarcastic]` 讽刺、`[curious]` 好奇、`[like dracula]` 低沉阴森、`[bored]` 无聊、`[tired]` 疲惫、`[scornful]` 轻蔑、`[shouting]` 大喊、`[asmr]` ASMR 轻柔耳语、`[panicked]` 恐慌、`[mischievously]` 调皮、`[empathetic]` 共情、`[whispers]` 耳语、`[reluctantly]` 不情愿、`[crying]` 哭泣、`[serious]` 严肃、`[very slowly]` 非常缓慢、`[very fast]` 非常快速\n- **富语言类标签**：在当前位置插入一段拟声效果，不影响前后文本的情感。`[gasp]` 倒吸一口气、`[sighing]` 叹息、`[clears throat]` 清嗓、`[giggles]` 咯咯笑、`[laughing]` 大笑、`[cough]` 咳嗽、`[snorts]` 哼声\n\n**示例：** `[excited]今天的天气真不错！[laughing]我们一起出去玩吧！`\n\n`enable_ssml` 为 `true` 时，本字段按 SSML 解析",
            "maxLength": 5000,
            "example": "我家的后面有一个很大的花园。"
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`prompt` 的别名，文本长度和使用规则与 `prompt` 相同\n\n- `prompt` 和 `input` 至少提供一个非空文本\n- 同时提供时内容必须一致，否则返回 `400`（`parameter_conflict`）",
            "maxLength": 5000,
            "example": "我家的后面有一个很大的花园。"
          },
          "voice": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "音色名称，区分大小写\n\n- 共 68 个系统音色，名称、性别、适用场景见 [音色列表](/cn/api-manual/audio-series/qwen-audio-tts/qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash-voices)\n- 不传时默认使用 `longanhuan_v3.1`\n- 也可以传你自己用 [Voice Enrollment](/cn/api-manual/audio-series/qwen-audio-tts/voice-enrollment) 创建的音色：复刻的形如 `qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash-{前缀}-{32 位标识}`，设计的形如 `qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash-vd-{前缀}-{32 位标识}`。只有创建它的账号能用；别的模型创建的音色（如 `qwen-voice-design` 的 `qwen-tts-vd-…`）不能用，返回 `400`（`invalid_voice`）；不存在或不属于你的音色返回 `404`（`voice_not_found`）\n- 自定义音色默认有效期为 `6 小时`，从创建任务完成时起算；到期后合成返回 `404`（`voice_expired`），需重新调用 Voice Enrollment 创建音色",
            "default": "longanhuan_v3.1",
            "example": "longanhuan_v3.1"
          },
          "response_format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "输出音频格式，支持 `mp3`、`wav`、`opus`，默认 `mp3`\n\n- `opus` 为 Ogg Opus 封装\n- 也可用 `format` 传入；建议只传一个，同时传入且取值不同时返回 `400`（`parameter_conflict`）",
            "enum": [
              "mp3",
              "wav",
              "opus"
            ],
            "default": "mp3",
            "example": "mp3"
          },
          "format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`response_format` 的别名，支持 `mp3`、`wav`、`opus`\n\n- 两个字段都未提供时默认使用 `mp3`\n- 同时提供时取值必须一致，否则返回 `400`（`parameter_conflict`）",
            "enum": [
              "mp3",
              "wav",
              "opus"
            ],
            "example": "mp3"
          },
          "sample_rate": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "输出采样率（Hz）\n\n- `response_format` 为 `opus` 时不支持 `22050` 和 `44100`\n- 不传或传 `null` 时使用默认值；传 `0` 或列表以外的值返回 `400`",
            "enum": [
              8000,
              12000,
              16000,
              22050,
              24000,
              44100,
              48000,
              null
            ],
            "default": 24000,
            "example": 24000
          },
          "volume": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "音量，取值范围 `0` ~ `100`",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100,
            "default": 50,
            "example": 50
          },
          "speech_rate": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "语速倍数\n\n- `1.0`：正常语速（默认）\n- `2.0`：两倍速；`0.5`：半速\n\n取值范围 `0.5` ~ `2.0`。调节语速不改变输出 token 数",
            "minimum": 0.5,
            "maximum": 2.0,
            "default": 1.0,
            "example": 1.0
          },
          "pitch": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "音调倍数\n\n- `1.0`：默认音调\n- 大于 `1.0` 声音更高，小于 `1.0` 声音更低\n\n取值范围 `0.5` ~ `2.0`\n\n**注意：调节音调会同时改变语速和音频时长**\n- 音调越高语速越快、时长越短，音调越低语速越慢、时长越长，时长大约按音调值的平方反比变化\n- 以一句 `1.0` 时约 2.8 秒的话为例：`0.8` 约 4.3 秒，`1.2` 约 2.1 秒，`0.5` 约 10.9 秒，`2.0` 约 0.7 秒\n- 建议在 `0.8` ~ `1.2` 之间微调；接近 `0.5` 或 `2.0` 时语音会明显过慢或过快\n- 同时传了不等于 `1.0` 的 `speech_rate` 时，`pitch` 不生效；两者不能叠加使用\n- 调节音调不改变输出 token 数",
            "minimum": 0.5,
            "maximum": 2.0,
            "default": 1.0,
            "example": 1.0
          },
          "instruction": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "自然语言指令，用于控制情感、语气、角色、方言等表达方式\n\n**约束：**\n- 不超过 `100` 计费字符：汉字（包括日文汉字、韩文汉字）按 2 计，其他字符按 1 计（假名、韩文字母均按 1 计；约 50 个汉字或 100 个英文字符），超出返回 `400`\n\n**示例：**\n- `用欢快、热情的语气说`\n- `请用上海话表达`（多语种与方言音色）\n- `Speak slowly in a calm and gentle tone`\n\n指令本身不计入输入 token，但会影响生成音频的时长，从而影响输出 token\n\n> 参数名为 `instruction`（单数），传 `instructions` 会返回 `400`",
            "example": "用欢快、热情的语气说"
          },
          "language": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "目标语种提示，用于改善数字、缩写、符号的读法和小语种的合成效果\n\n例如英文句子 `hello, this is 110` 传 `zh` 时，`110` 读作「幺幺零」\n\n| 值 | 语种 | 值 | 语种 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `zh` | 中文 | `th` | 泰语 |\n| `en` | 英语 | `id` | 印尼语 |\n| `fr` | 法语 | `vi` | 越南语 |\n| `de` | 德语 | `es` | 西班牙语 |\n| `ja` | 日语 | `it` | 意大利语 |\n| `ko` | 韩语 | `ms` | 马来语 |\n| `ru` | 俄语 | `fil` | 菲律宾语 |\n| `pt` | 葡萄牙语 | `ar` | 阿拉伯语 |\n\n不传时由模型自动判断；本参数不会翻译文本",
            "enum": [
              "zh",
              "en",
              "fr",
              "de",
              "ja",
              "ko",
              "ru",
              "pt",
              "th",
              "id",
              "vi",
              "es",
              "it",
              "ms",
              "fil",
              "ar"
            ],
            "example": "zh"
          },
          "enable_ssml": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否按 SSML 解析 `prompt`\n\n开启后可使用 SSML 标签，例如用 `<break time=\"1s\"/>` 插入停顿：\n`<speak>欢迎收听今天的节目。<break time=\"1s\"/>我们马上开始。</speak>`\n\nSSML 插入的停顿不计入输出 token",
            "default": false,
            "example": false
          },
          "hot_fix": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "自定义发音与文本替换，用于纠正多音字、专有名词等读音\n\n- `pronunciation`：为指定词语标注拼音（音节间用空格分隔，声调用数字标注，如 `tian1 qi4`），纠正默认读音\n- `replace`：合成前把指定词语替换为目标文本，按替换后的文本合成和计费；替换后的文本同样不能超过 `5000` 字符，超出返回 `400`（`prompt_too_long`）\n\n两类词条合计最多 `200` 条（按对象中的键值对计数），超过返回 `400`（`invalid_parameter`）\n\n两项至少传一项，每项为非空数组，数组元素为 `{\"词语\": \"值\"}` 形式的对象\n\n**示例：**\n```json\n{\n  \"pronunciation\": [{\"天气\": \"tian1 qi4\"}],\n  \"replace\": [{\"今天\": \"金天\"}]\n}\n```",
            "properties": {
              "pronunciation": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "自定义发音列表，每项为 `{\"词语\": \"拼音\"}`",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "example": [
                  {
                    "天气": "tian1 qi4"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "replace": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "文本替换列表，每项为 `{\"原词\": \"替换文本\"}`",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "example": [
                  {
                    "今天": "金天"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "enable_aigc_tag": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否在生成的音频中嵌入 AIGC 隐性标识（`wav` / `mp3` / `opus` 格式生效）",
            "default": false,
            "example": false
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务完成后的HTTPS回调地址\n\n**回调时机：**\n- 任务完成（completed）或失败（failed）时触发；本模型不支持取消\n- 在计费确认完成后发送\n\n**安全限制：**\n- 仅支持HTTPS协议\n- 禁止回调到内网IP地址（127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x、192.168.x.x等）\n- URL长度不超过`2048`字符\n\n**回调机制：**\n- 超时时间：`10`秒\n- 失败后最多重试`3`次（会分别在失败的`1`秒/`2`秒/`4`秒后进行重试）\n- 回调响应体格式与任务查询接口返回的格式一致\n- 回调地址若返回2xx状态码视为成功，其他状态码会触发重试",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/webhooks/tts-completed"
          }
        }
      },
      "QwenAudioTtsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "created": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务创建时间戳",
            "example": 1790000000
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务ID",
            "example": "task-unified-1790000000-abcd1234"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "实际使用的模型名称",
            "example": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-flash"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "audio.generation.task"
            ],
            "description": "任务的具体类型"
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务进度百分比 (0-100)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100,
            "example": 0
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务状态",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "pending"
          },
          "task_info": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AudioTaskInfo",
            "description": "音频任务详细信息"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "audio"
            ],
            "description": "任务的输出类型",
            "example": "audio"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AudioUsage",
            "description": "使用量和计费信息"
          }
        }
      },
      "AudioTaskInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "can_cancel": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "任务是否可以取消（本模型不支持取消）",
            "example": false
          },
          "estimated_time": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "预估完成时间（秒），随文本长度增加，最长约 `90` 秒",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 3
          },
          "audio_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "音频任务类型",
            "example": "tts"
          }
        }
      },
      "AudioUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "使用量信息",
        "properties": {
          "credits_reserved": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "预扣积分数（按文本长度预估，任务完成后按实际 token 用量结算，多退少补）",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 0.0144
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误代码标识符"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
